  # PeopleService.GetEnrollmentBoard

  A period's sections with their occupancy and its enrollments

  `/ltedu.people.v1.PeopleService/GetEnrollmentBoard` · unary · `ltedu/people/v1/people.proto`

  ## Request — `GetEnrollmentBoardRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `period_id` | `string` |  |
  | `level_id` | `string` |  |
  | `grade_id` | `string` |  |
  | `section_id` | `string` |  |
  | `status` | `string` |  |
  | `query` | `string` |  |
  | `limit` | `int32` |  |
  | `offset` | `int32` |  |

  ## Response — `GetEnrollmentBoardResponse`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `period` | `Period` |  |
  | `sections` | `repeated Section` |  |
  | `occupancy` | `repeated SectionOccupancy` |  |
  | `enrollments` | `repeated Enrollment` |  |
  | `total` | `int32` |  |
  | `units` | `repeated Subject` | Institutes: units of the plans in force; subject.curriculum_id is not set, grade_ids give the semester |
  | `unit_level_ids` | `repeated string` | Program (level) of each unit, same order as units |

